{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉投票。廉政公署表示，會嚴格執行《選舉（舞弊及非法行為）條例》，派員巡視投票站及點票中心，確保今次選舉能公平、公開和誠實地進行。<br/>\n<br/>\n廉署表示，廉潔選舉查詢熱線由上午9時至下午6時運作，接受查詢。又呼籲合資格的投票人和獲授權代表，踴躍投票，選出心儀的候選人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:43:12.834225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:27:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:27.945197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:36:45.650373+00:00","content_hash":"686a66a17ec30d9fafd1cd2de0ad017dbe45c428da79ee073f4173a1251b060c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}